This directory contains only public Sovereign OS update verification keys.

Each key uses two files with the same safe key identifier:

  <key-id>.pem   Ed25519 public key in PEM SubjectPublicKeyInfo format
  <key-id>.json  trusted metadata with algorithm, channels, and revoked status

`sovereign-production-1` is the production key generated under the custody
decided in ADR-0006 (see docs/adrs/0006-production-signing-key-custody.md
in the source repository): an Ed25519 keypair whose private half is held
as an encrypted secret in the maintainer's password manager, never
committed to this repository or baked into any image. It is trusted for
both the `preview` and `stable` channels.

Routine rotation does not require manually copying files here again:
`sovereign-update rotate-trust` applies signed rotation manifests (see
update/README.md's "Trust Rotation v1" section in the source repository).
